---
import EditorialPage from '../components/EditorialPage.astro';
import Panel from '../components/Panel.astro';
import visionImage from '../assets/images/vision-horizon.png';

const sections = [
  { id: 'top', label: 'Vision' },
  { id: 'principles', label: 'Principles' },
  { id: 'belief', label: 'A modest role' }
];
---

<EditorialPage
  activePage="vision"
  eyebrow="Our vision"
  title="Help should move sideways."
  lead="A world where help reaches people from neighbour to neighbour, across borders — instead of falling on them from above."
  description="Our vision is a more equal way of helping, where local people lead decisions and outside support makes their work possible."
  image={visionImage}
  imageAlt="People walk along a quiet road toward open fields in the early morning."
  caption="A fairer future is built one local decision at a time."
  nextHref="/who-we-are/"
  nextLabel="Meet the people behind the work"
  sections={sections}
  total={3}
>
  <!-- 02 — Principles -->
  <Panel id="principles" ground="sand" index={2} total={3} label="Principles" labelledby="vision-principles-title" nextId="belief" nextLabel="A modest role">
    <div class="panel-head panel-head--split">
      <div class="panel-head__title">
        <p class="eyebrow reveal">The world we want to help build</p>
        <h2 class="reveal" style="--i:1" id="vision-principles-title">Support should add power to people’s choices, not replace them.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="lead reveal" style="--i:2">The distance between a person who wants to help and a person who needs help should not erase the knowledge, agency or dignity of either.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="principles principles--editorial">
      <article class="principle-item reveal" style="--i:3">
        <header class="principle-item__head">
          <span class="principle-item__num">01</span>
          <span class="principle-item__kicker">Core Mandate</span>
        </header>
        <h3 class="principle-item__title">Local leadership</h3>
        <p class="principle-item__body">The best decisions are usually made by people who understand the place, the relationships and the consequences.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="principle-item reveal" style="--i:4">
        <header class="principle-item__head">
          <span class="principle-item__num">02</span>
          <span class="principle-item__kicker">Approach</span>
        </header>
        <h3 class="principle-item__title">Dignity in the details</h3>
        <p class="principle-item__body">Good help is practical and respectful. It gives people room to choose, ask questions and say no.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="principle-item reveal" style="--i:5">
        <header class="principle-item__head">
          <span class="principle-item__num">03</span>
          <span class="principle-item__kicker">Goal</span>
        </header>
        <h3 class="principle-item__title">Needed a little less</h3>
        <p class="principle-item__body">Success is not making an organisation permanent. It is strengthening the systems a community already owns.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </Panel>

  <!-- 03 — Belief -->
  <Panel id="belief" ground="paper" index={3} total={3} label="Belief" labelledby="belief-title" ctaHref="/who-we-are/" ctaLabel="Meet the people">
    <div class="panel-head">
      <p class="eyebrow reveal">A modest role</p>
      <h2 class="reveal" style="--i:1" id="belief-title">Bring resources. Remove obstacles. Then make space.</h2>
    </div>

    <!-- 3-Step Modest Action Flow -->
    <div class="modest-flow reveal" style="--i:2">
      <div class="modest-step">
        <span class="modest-step__num">01</span>
        <h3 class="modest-step__title">Bring Resources</h3>
        <p class="modest-step__desc">Deliver grants, clean water equipment, and medical supplies directly into the hands of local organizers.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="modest-step">
        <span class="modest-step__num">02</span>
        <h3 class="modest-step__title">Remove Obstacles</h3>
        <p class="modest-step__desc">Handle transport, border permits, and legal paperwork so local teams focus entirely on field execution.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="modest-step">
        <span class="modest-step__num">03</span>
        <h3 class="modest-step__title">Make Space</h3>
        <p class="modest-step__desc">Transfer project governance, sign off audits, and step aside as community management takes full control.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="columns columns--wide prose reveal" style="--i:3; margin-top: var(--space-6);">
      <p>The most useful role for an outside organisation is a modest one: bring resources, remove obstacles, share responsibility and then step back. That means giving up the need to be the hero of every story.</p>
      <p>Our vision is ambitious, but the work is ordinary. It is a conversation with a teacher, a repaired roof, a stocked clinic, a community meeting where the right person is finally heard.</p>
    </div>

    <blockquote class="editorial-quote reveal" style="--i:4; margin-top: var(--space-7);">
      <p class="editorial-quote__text">“We would like to be a small part of that future, and then to be needed a little less each year.”</p>
      <cite class="editorial-quote__cite">— Field Journal Reflection, 2026</cite>
    </blockquote>
  </Panel>
</EditorialPage>
